  "description": "Typed AI decisions for .NET. Ask Jev - TypeSafe AI's System One model - yes/no, single-choice and rated questions about any text or object, and get back a C# enum with a calibrated probability and a confidence score instead of prose to parse. Your enum is the option list; confidence tells you when to escalate to a human. One dependency, retries and Retry-After built in, trim- and AOT-safe, and fifteen examples that run offline without an API key.",
